{"id":"niydgvoe43k5r63jjdltqcr9m","title":"2026 年全球化石燃料碳排放量预计下降 0.4%","originalTitle":null,"summary":"2026 年全球化石燃料碳排放量预计下降 0.4%，其中石油相关排放量预计下降 1.9%。尽管全球能源需求持续增长，三分之二增量已被清洁能源发展所抵消。然而，土地利用变化导致总排放量略有增加，预计 2026 年全球二氧化碳排放总量将达到 433 亿吨。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot"},"links":{"original":"https://www.solidot.org/story?sid=85850"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:23:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T17:14:15.124Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T17:14:15.124Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["研究成果"],"score":39,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2352bb32-1c4d-4b68-9289-190b3dbe8d5f","title":"Global Carbon Project预测2026年化石燃料排放下降0.4%，但总排放仍增4.3%"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2352bb32-1c4d-4b68-9289-190b3dbe8d5f","title":"Global Carbon Project预测2026年化石燃料排放下降0.4%，但总排放仍增4.3%"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ftj2VJvRETsU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}